    "### <img src=\"tutorial-icons/look_back.png\" alt=\"Look Back\" width=\"30\" style=\"vertical-align:middle; margin-right:8px;\"> Look Back\n",
    "\n",
    "Answer before choosing a threshold:\n",
    "\n",
    "1. Which threshold catches the largest share of actual purchasers?\n",
    "2. Which threshold avoids the most false positives?\n",
    "3. Does the highest accuracy also provide the preferred error balance?\n",
    "4. Who benefits from a lower threshold?\n",
    "5. Who receives more unwanted targeting?\n",
    "6. What objective would have to be stated before a threshold could be justified?\n",
    "7. Which decisions should never be based on this small advertising example?\n"
   ]
