    "# <img src=\"tutorial-icons/level_2.png\" alt=\"Level 2 Challenge\" width=\"44\" style=\"vertical-align:middle; margin-right:10px;\"> Level 2 — Optional Deep Dive\n",
    "\n",
    "> **Challenge ahead:** Complete Level 1 first; this optional route adds a harder application of the same reading.\n",
    "\n",
    "# Part 6: Multinomial Logistic Regression With `iris.csv`\n",
