   "source": [
    "## <img src=\"tutorial-icons/claude_task.png\" alt=\"Claude Task\" width=\"36\" style=\"vertical-align:middle; margin-right:9px;\"> Claude Coding Task 6: Load and Prepare the Iris Dataset\n",
    "\n",
    "```text\n",
    "Write one Jupyter Notebook code cell that:\n",
    "\n",
    "1. loads iris.csv;\n",
    "2. confirms that sepal.length, sepal.width, petal.length, petal.width,\n",
    "   and variety exist;\n",
    "3. prints the shape, missing-value counts, and class counts;\n",
    "4. creates a numeric variety code using pandas.Categorical;\n",
    "5. creates and displays a lookup table connecting each original variety name\n",
    "   to its numeric code;\n",
    "6. preserves the original variety text;\n",
    "7. names the dataframe iris.\n",
    "\n",
    "Do not fit a model.\n",
    "Return only the Python code.\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "### <img src=\"tutorial-icons/your_workspace.png\" alt=\"Your Workspace\" width=\"30\" style=\"vertical-align:middle; margin-right:8px;\"> Your Workspace\n",
    "\n",
    "Paste, read, and run Claude's response in the next cell.\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "94e7b4b2",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# YOUR WORKSPACE — Claude Coding Task 6\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "c89711d0",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### <img src=\"tutorial-icons/reference_solution.png\" alt=\"Reference Solution\" width=\"30\" style=\"vertical-align:middle; margin-right:8px;\"> Reference Solution for Task 6\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "03066a40",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "iris_path = Path(\"iris.csv\")\n",
    "assert iris_path.exists(), f\"File not found: {iris_path.resolve()}\"\n",
    "\n",
    "iris = pd.read_csv(iris_path)\n",
    "\n",
    "iris_features = [\n",
    "    \"sepal.length\",\n",
    "    \"sepal.width\",\n",
    "    \"petal.length\",\n",
    "    \"petal.width\",\n",
    "]\n",
    "iris_required = iris_features + [\"variety\"]\n",
    "\n",
    "missing_iris_columns = sorted(set(iris_required) - set(iris.columns))\n",
    "assert not missing_iris_columns, (\n",
    "    f\"Missing required Iris columns: {missing_iris_columns}\"\n",
    ")\n",
    "\n",
    "iris = iris[iris_required].copy()\n",
    "iris[\"variety_original\"] = iris[\"variety\"].astype(str)\n",
    "iris[\"variety_code\"] = pd.Categorical(iris[\"variety_original\"]).codes\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"Shape:\", iris.shape)\n",
    "print(\"\\nMissing values:\")\n",
    "display(iris[iris_required].isna().sum().to_frame(\"missing_count\"))\n",
    "print(\"\\nClass counts:\")\n",
    "display(iris[\"variety_original\"].value_counts().to_frame(\"count\"))\n",
    "\n",
    "class_lookup = (\n",
    "    iris[[\"variety_original\", \"variety_code\"]]\n",
    "    .drop_duplicates()\n",
    "    .sort_values(\"variety_code\")\n",
    "    .reset_index(drop=True)\n",
    ")\n",
    "display(class_lookup)\n"
   ]
  },
