   "source": [
    "# Part 7: Fit and Evaluate the Multiclass Model\n",
    "\n",
    "The same human–AI rules still apply:\n",
    "\n",
    "- split before standardization;\n",
    "- stratify by the response;\n",
    "- keep the test set untouched;\n",
