  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "880a31fe",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## <img src=\"tutorial-icons/claude_task.png\" alt=\"Claude Task\" width=\"36\" style=\"vertical-align:middle; margin-right:9px;\"> Claude Coding Task 7: Multinomial Fit and Test Evaluation\n",
    "\n",
    "```text\n",
    "Using iris:\n",
    "\n",
    "1. remove rows missing any predictor or variety_code;\n",
    "2. create a stratified 80/20 split with random_state = 1099;\n",
    "3. create a Pipeline that standardizes all four continuous predictors with StandardScaler and then fits LogisticRegression;\n",
    "4. set max_iter = 2000;\n",
    "5. fit only on the training data;\n",
    "6. calculate test predictions and class probabilities;\n",
    "7. calculate accuracy and macro one-vs-rest ROC AUC;\n",
    "8. display a labeled confusion matrix;\n",
    "9. create a table with actual class, predicted class, and the maximum predicted\n",
    "   probability for each test observation;\n",
    "10. name the model iris_logistic_model.\n",
    "\n",
    "Return only the Python code.\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "### <img src=\"tutorial-icons/your_workspace.png\" alt=\"Your Workspace\" width=\"30\" style=\"vertical-align:middle; margin-right:8px;\"> Your Workspace\n",
    "\n",
    "Paste, read, and run Claude's response in the next cell.\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "1a98a0b6",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# YOUR WORKSPACE — Claude Coding Task 7\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "89a465e6",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### <img src=\"tutorial-icons/reference_solution.png\" alt=\"Reference Solution\" width=\"30\" style=\"vertical-align:middle; margin-right:8px;\"> Reference Solution for Task 7\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "05761af5",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "from sklearn.metrics import roc_auc_score\n",
    "\n",
    "iris_model_data = iris.dropna(\n",
    "    subset=iris_features + [\"variety_code\"]\n",
    ").copy()\n",
    "\n",
    "X_iris = iris_model_data[iris_features]\n",
    "y_iris = iris_model_data[\"variety_code\"].astype(int)\n",
    "\n",
    "X_iris_train, X_iris_test, y_iris_train, y_iris_test = train_test_split(\n",
    "    X_iris,\n",
    "    y_iris,\n",
    "    test_size=0.20,\n",
    "    random_state=1099,\n",
    "    stratify=y_iris,\n",
    ")\n",
    "\n",
    "iris_logistic_model = Pipeline(\n",
    "    steps=[\n",
    "        (\"standardize\", StandardScaler()),\n",
    "        (\n",
    "            \"logistic\",\n",
    "            LogisticRegression(\n",
    "                max_iter=2000,\n",
    "                random_state=1099,\n",
    "            ),\n",
    "        ),\n",
    "    ]\n",
    ")\n",
    "\n",
    "iris_logistic_model.fit(X_iris_train, y_iris_train)\n",
    "\n",
    "iris_pred = iris_logistic_model.predict(X_iris_test)\n",
    "iris_probability = iris_logistic_model.predict_proba(X_iris_test)\n",
    "\n",
    "iris_accuracy = accuracy_score(y_iris_test, iris_pred)\n",
    "iris_macro_auc = roc_auc_score(\n",
    "    y_iris_test,\n",
    "    iris_probability,\n",
    "    multi_class=\"ovr\",\n",
    "    average=\"macro\",\n",
    ")\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f\"Test accuracy: {iris_accuracy:.3f}\")\n",
    "print(f\"Macro one-vs-rest ROC AUC: {iris_macro_auc:.3f}\")\n",
    "\n",
    "iris_cm = confusion_matrix(y_iris_test, iris_pred)\n",
    "ConfusionMatrixDisplay(\n",
    "    confusion_matrix=iris_cm,\n",
    "    display_labels=class_lookup[\"variety_original\"].tolist(),\n",
    ").plot(values_format=\"d\")\n",
    "plt.title(\"Iris Multinomial Logistic Regression\")\n",
    "plt.show()\n",
    "\n",
    "iris_probability_table = X_iris_test.copy()\n",
    "iris_probability_table[\"ActualCode\"] = y_iris_test\n",
    "iris_probability_table[\"PredictedCode\"] = iris_pred\n",
    "iris_probability_table[\"MaximumPredictedProbability\"] = (\n",
    "    iris_probability.max(axis=1)\n",
    ")\n",
    "\n",
    "display(\n",
    "    iris_probability_table\n",
    "    .sort_values(\"MaximumPredictedProbability\")\n",
    "    .head(15)\n",
    ")\n"
   ]
